      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "the problem is, stuff like draw distance has to be done by the world creator by adding LOD groups and adjusting the Far Clip on the ref. camera. The far clip could easily be overridden by the game itself (though it clips literally everything, including the world) but i don't think LOD groups could easily be added while the game is running.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
