      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a4f82c1a3192e49202db1f7|full_name}: ok, I've just read the manual about that, and.. can those groups be used already right now if the world creators set them up? And on the other post I was suggesting some kind of automatic mesh decimation if objects are far away; that would basically be that.\n\nWhat I suggested here was to just not draw vertecies/faces/edges, that are further away than a set value. This does not mean different levels of detail.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
